	quest.D7CC07EDED5AEA39.quest_desc: [
		"Lt. Surge spawns in plains and other sparse grassland."
		""
		"Gym leaders are RCT key trainers: they spawn near you in those biomes once you've beaten the key trainers before them. Gyms 1-4 will also live in the hub town."
		""
		"Your whole party must be at or under your level cap to battle."
	]
